# 统一行尾策略：存储用 LF，避免 CRLF 转换在 diff 与打包时产生噪音。
# 特别地，packaging/android/*.sh 在 WSL/bash 中执行，必须保持 LF；
# Windows 脚本（.ps1/.bat）检出时使用 CRLF。
* text=auto

*.py   text eol=lf
*.pyi  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.spec text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.cmake text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf

*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.cer binary
